<title>UK: Sweden doubles three-year bond to 600 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Sweden doubles three-year bond to 600 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden has increased to 600 million Danish crowns from 300 million crowns the size of a 4.00 percent four-year bond, lead manager Enskilda Debt Capital Markets said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal, on which Sydbank AS is co-lead manager, was launched on Tuesday.</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN DKK   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    15.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE   STRAIGHT	ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FEES   UNDISCLOSED   LISTING    COPENHAGEN</p>
